65,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Misaki, you’re right. Midwifery has slack, and Option D uses existing staff. It avoids the fragile joint ownership that sank the clinic. I feel safer with D.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, I appreciate the correction. If visits are logged, Option A avoids the tracking gap. It also fits within current staffing, unlike B or D.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, Option D bills standard rates. It uses existing midwifery slack, avoiding the agency costs that are currently draining our budget. It is financially viable.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, you’re right. Option D bills on-site and uses existing slack. It’s the only one that doesn’t bleed money. I’m voting D.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I am glad you see sense. Option D fits our midwifery slack and uses existing rooms. It respects our physical limits. I vote D.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I’m relieved you agree. Option D uses existing midwifery slack, avoiding the fragile joint ownership that sank the clinic. I feel safer with D.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, I appreciate the clarity. Option D’s scheduled nature ensures we can finally measure impact, unlike the buried initiatives of the past. I vote D.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, I agree. Option D leverages the midwifery slack without straining the nursing vacancies. It is the only sustainable choice. I vote D.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, I am voting D. It is the only option that generates revenue without breaking the bank. Let’s finalize this.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
