77,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote D. It uses the midwifery slack without adding pressure to the vacant nursing posts. It is the only sustainable option.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,I vote D. It is the only choice that respects the ledger and generates actual revenue. Let us close this.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I vote D. It fits gently into our day without breaking the flow. Thank you all for your patience and care.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
